note Dump the integer cell endpoints used by all three numerical verifiers.
text space " "
text newline "\n"
fn main to int
initTrigGrid
for i ulong 2048
uPrintU i
uPrint space
uPrintI get gridLo add i 1
uPrint space
uPrintI get gridHi i
uPrint space
uPrintU gridSinSqLoUnits i
uPrint space
uPrintU gridSinSqHiUnits i
uPrint newline
end
ret 0
end
